  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Property Tax Reform in City Councils in Sierra Leone</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve property tax regimes in cities in Sierra Leone aims by mobilising reliable municipal tax revenues to pay for local public services and provide an equitable tax regime with salient public service benefits and thereby maximise residents&#x2019; buy-in. It will also provide a straightforward, transparent, and efficiently administered regime</narrative>
  </description>
